 Good Monday morning! Smart Brevity™ count: 1,718 words ... 6½ mins. Thanks to Erica Pandey for orchestrating. Edited by Bill Kole. 

 🚀 Tomorrow is launch day for our new book, "Simplify." If you enjoy Axios or Smart Brevity, you'll love "Simplify." Get it here . 

 I'm in New York with co-authors Jim VandeHei and Roy Schwartz, and our morning is jammed: Catch all three of us on MS NOW's "Morning Joe" at 7 a.m. ET. Jim and I will join "CBS Mornings" at 8:15 a.m. Then I'll see you on CNBC's "Closing Bell" this evening and "Squawk Box" tomorrow. 🙏 All my proceeds go to the Zotheka Foundation, which helps put promising kids through college and matches them with mentors. 💵 Axios BFD is back Nov. 17 in NYC with speakers including 1789 Capital's Donald Trump Jr. and Omeed Malik, Goldman Sachs' Kim Posnett, baseball icon and investor Alex Rodriguez, Vista Equity Partners' Robert F. Smith and more. Request an invite . 

 
 
