 4. 📚 Reading rut 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics . Chart: Sami Sparber/Axios Just over 16% of Americans read for pleasure on an average day last year, Axios' Sami Sparber writes from new government data. 

 We spent an average of 16 minutes per day reading for pleasure in 2025, but an average of 2.6 hours watching TV. Share this chart . 

 
 
